OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle flats fire after
OL,4,Asmoke spotted
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have tackled a fire at a
OL,7,Fblock of flats in Southampton.
OL,9,FFirefighters in 10 fire engines along
OL,10,Fwith two aerial ladder platforms were
OL,11,Fsent to the block on Anglesea Terrace
OL,12,Fafter passers-by reported seeing smoke
OL,13,Fcoming from the five storey building at
OL,14,Fabout 06:00 BST.
OL,16,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire & Rescue
OL,17,FService said the fire was out shortly
OL,18,Fbefore 09:00. Crews from six fire
OL,19,Fengines, along with an aerial ladder
OL,20,Fplatform and support vehicles, remain
OL,21,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
